magnum: pin setuptools <82.

setuptools 82 removed pkg_resources [1], but magnum-cluster-api still
imports it to find the charts and manifests it ships. magnum-conductor
loads that driver at startup, so the container aborts with
ModuleNotFoundError and never reaches a running state.

Debian Trixie and Rocky Linux 10 images are affected, Ubuntu Noble is
not. The real fix is in magnum-cluster-api, which needs to move to
importlib.resources [2]; pin setuptools until that merges, then revert
as was done for horizon in Iced7662f7e58b9f094306e9a6c4f1b5a79f48b17.

[1] https://setuptools.pypa.io/en/stable/history.html#v82-0-0
[2] https://github.com/vexxhost/magnum-cluster-api/pull/925

Prompt: Michael asked about unblocking Magnum CI while waiting for the
upstream patches to merge.

